   "source": [
    "# 🌿 Mint Leaf AI — STEP 9: Final Scientific Model Comparison & Analysis Layer\n",
    "\n",
    "Welcome to **Step 9** of the Mint Leaf AI project (`15_final_scientific_model_comparison.ipynb`). In this notebook, we synthesize our empirical findings across all 25 image-classification architectures, statistical confidence intervals, cross-domain generalization metrics, and Pareto efficiency trade-offs.\n",
    "\n",
    "--- \n",
    "\n",
    "### 🔬 Step 9 Core Scientific Sections:\n",
    "1. **9A — Master Multi-Metric Model Comparison**: Aggregate Macro F1, Accuracy, Balanced Accuracy, Minority-Class Recall, Parameters, Latency, and Model Size.\n",
    "2. **9B — Statistical Group Ranking**: Group models into statistically indistinguishable tiers without claiming unverified superiority.\n",
    "3. **9C — Pareto Efficiency & Deployment Analysis**: Identify optimal production, edge, and baseline model candidates along the Pareto frontier.\n",
    "4. **9D — External Domain Generalization Ranking**: Compare in-domain vs unseen out-of-domain performance ($\Delta \\text{F1}$ and degradation %).\n",
    "5. **9E — Target Error & Failure Analysis**: Inspect misclassifications and minority-class boundary confusions.\n",
    "\n",
    "--- \n",
    "\n",
    "⚠️ **Constraint Checklist**:\n",
    "- [x] Export `master_model_comparison.csv`, `statistical_significance_rankings.csv`, `pareto_tradeoff_rankings.csv`, `external_generalization_rankings.csv`, `error_and_failure_analysis.csv` under `outputs/reports/model_suite/`.\n",
    "- [x] Export visual evidence plots under `outputs/visualizations/model_suite/`.\n",
    "- [x] Export `step9_model_comparison_report.md` and `step9_model_comparison_report.json`.\n",
    "- [x] **STOP after Step 9**: Wait for user review before proceeding to Step 10!"
   ]
  },
  {
